actual achieved capability, remaining alternatives and needed distinguishing constraints.","status":"partial","completionProved":false,"observedCoverage":"Conditional orientation consequences, timing anchors and finite reading controls execute. The exact two-probe criterion accounts for all 10,296 indexed word pairs in the optional twelve-completion family: 4,608 sufficient pairs and 5,688 explicit collision witnesses. The earlier phase-orbit result is reused.","notYetSatisfied":"No independent historical phase constraints are admitted. Source-defined bridges, shared frame/origin, alternative families, withheld-target preregistration and independent blind evaluation remain unresolved; full novelty is not established.","evidence":["state/reconstruction/orientation-predictions.json","state/delivery-2026-11-07/global-closure/phase-probe-designs.json","docs/delivery-2026-11-07/PHASE_PROBE_DESIGNS.md","state/delivery-2026-11-07/mathematics/score-anchors.json","state/reconstruction/reading-operations.json"],"completionEvidenceNeeded":"Source- and derivation-bound evidence covering the complete requirement, including independent acceptance at its stated scope."},{"id":"G13","requirement":"Have actual Jev construct and direct substantive investigative choices and remain integrated into ongoing operation. Examine local, intermediate and global perspectives; retain plausible component candidates and exact discrepancies; avoid repetitive debates and dead ends. Preserve inference receipts and model identity. Distinguish model preferences from mathematical results. Use applicable named plugins and report unavailable capabilities honestly.","status":"partial","completionProved":false,"observedCoverage":"Actual pinned local AgentJev-0.6B receipts 57–63 direct visual architecture, timing anchors, contextual history, Molin reading operations and the global constraint/dependency extension. Receipt 59 was submitted through the actual browser interface.","notYetSatisfied":"Hosted private-payload call was rejected; provider account/billing is unverified. Automatic observers cannot route or certify. Ongoing choices require their own exact receipts.","evidence":["state/jev-receipts/000057-95bc223acd84.json","state/jev-receipts/000058-bbb3ab44bbf5.json","state/jev-receipts/000059-6581ee8c1ffa.json","state/jev-receipts/000060-a1b30f75db7d.json","state/jev-receipts/000061-54b57b45fbcd.json","state/jev-receipts/000062-5fcc72f3ccd7.json","state/jev-receipts/000063-298ff24c136a.json","scripts/delivery_server.py"],"completionEvidenceNeeded":"Source- and derivation-bound evidence covering the complete requirement, including independent acceptance at its stated scope."},{"id":"G14","requirement":"Make the process fast, automated, continuous and cumulative. Reuse completed work; distribute genuinely independent work across plugin-supported agents where appropriate; automate repeatable extraction, calculation, comparison, dependency updates and checks; maintain resumable state and support real between-turn execution through an actual running mechanism. Reduce the user's supervision and recall burden.","status":"partial","completionProved":false,"observedCoverage":"Reproducible builders, exact calculations, source-preserving checks and local preview exist. Later initialized independent reviewers reproduced bounded calculations and source researchers saved acquisition checkpoints.","notYetSatisfied":"Initial workers failed to initialize. Local services stopped across a turn transition and a substantial cadence gap was recorded. Uninterrupted background research is not established by files, timers or a live service.","evidence":["scripts/build_delivery.py","scripts/derive_score_anchors.py","scripts/start-delivery.ps1","docs/delivery-2026-11-07/INDEPENDENT_REVIEW.md","state/delivery-2026-11-07/cadence-gap.json","CONTINUE.md"],"completionEvidenceNeeded":"Source- and derivation-bound evidence covering the complete requirement, including independent acceptance at its stated scope."},{"id":"G15","requirement":"Preserve the user's semantics and distinct project boundaries. Carry corrections forward without predetermining hypotheses, conflating SUNNY with SUN, SOL, SOFI, SATURN, COSMIC or adjacent projects, deleting inputs, or restarting solved work. Derive type laws progressively from the reconstructed full musical structure.","status":"partial","completionProved":false,"observedCoverage":"The full goal register and source-native axes are retained; no date/zodiac rewrite bypasses symbol-first dependencies.","notYetSatisfied":"Full corpus semantic incorporation and all progressively derived type/adaptor laws remain incomplete; continuity must keep preserving corrections and counterexamples.","evidence":["state/mission.json","state/reconstruction/derived-laws.json","docs/reconstruction/SUNNY_GOALS.md"],"completionEvidenceNeeded":"Source- and derivation-bound evidence covering the complete requirement, including independent acceptance at its stated scope."},{"id":"G16","requirement":"For every substantive SUNNY question, recover prior art, established positions, competing explanations, known solutions and counterexamples through first-order and First & 3/4 Order research. Determine what can be reused, what transfers under stated conditions and what remains to derive. Preserve the dated independent formulation and evidence exposure history.","status":"partial","completionProved":false,"observedCoverage":"Bounded P0-A fourteen-question accounting, source-specific scholarly packets and reused exact linear-algebra prior art exist.","notYetSatisfied":"The complete recurring first-order/First &3/4 Order research program, competing positions, negative searches and transfer/reproduction checks remain to complete.","evidence":["state/research/reactivation/symbols/p0a-14-baseline.json","docs/reconstruction/symbol-sound-census/reading-tradition-prior-art.json","state/delivery-2026-11-07/mathematics/score-anchors.json"],"completionEvidenceNeede